---
---

<section id="kontakt-ring" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background image with overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0" style="background: var(--color-primary-container); opacity: 0.92;"></div>
  <img
    class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover mix-blend-overlay z-0"
    src="/img/rygning.webp"
    alt="Nærbillede af gyldne tækkestrå"
    loading="lazy"
  />

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 text-center text-white">
    <h2 class="mb-8 leading-tight" style="font-family: var(--font-headline); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);">
      Skal vi tjekke dit tag?
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="font-size: 1.2rem; color: #ffdcc1; font-family: var(--font-body);">
      Vi tilbyder gratis gennemgang og vurdering af dit stråtags tilstand samt hurtig respons på alle henvendelser.
    </p>
    <a
      href="tel:+4524248080"
      class="inline-block px-10 py-5 rounded-lg font-bold text-xl uppercase tracking-widest shadow-2xl transition-colors hover:bg-primary-fixed"
      style="background: #fff; color: var(--color-primary); font-family: var(--font-body);"
      onmouseover="this.style.background='#ffdcc1'" onmouseout="this.style.background='#fff'"
    >
      Ring: 24 24 80 80
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
